OL,3,GNEWSAHow to talk to your kids about
OL,4,Aback to school nerves
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools, parents and pupils are
OL,7,Fpreparing for the new school year, but
OL,8,Ffor many this can be a nerve-wracking
OL,9,Ftime.
OL,11,FMindworks Surrey, an NHS-led mental
OL,12,Fhealth service for children and young
OL,13,Fpeople, has launched Small Steps Back
OL,14,Fto School - a campaign offering
OL,15,Fpractical advice on common
OL,16,Fback-to-school concerns.
OL,18,FAoife Kearney-Grieve, a cognitive
OL,19,Fbehavioural therapist at the
OL,20,Forganisation said there was a lot that
OL,21,Fgoes into school absences, but anxiety
OL,22,Fwas definitely a factor.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
